      ],
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "EmotionEffect": "FUN",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭐 아무튼! 이 몸은 최강이다! 용족이니까!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "まあ、なんとあれ！わがはいは最強なのだ！竜族だし？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "누나, 누나! 나 궁금한 거 있어.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ねえちゃん、ねえちゃん！聞きたいことがあるんだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "후후! 말해보거라 인간 소년. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふふ、申してみるのだ、人間の少年よ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "누나는 용족이니까, 막 <color=#F7BE45>악룡 켈베론</color>처럼 날개도 있어? 하늘도 날 수 있고? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "おねえちゃんは竜族だから、<color=#F7BE45>悪竜ケルベロン</color>みたいに翼があるの？空も飛べる？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나, 날개…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "つ、翼…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "못 날아?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "飛べないの？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…큭, 크하하! 당연히 날 수 있지! 이 몸이 못할 건 없다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…くっ、くはは！もちろん飛べるぞよ？わがはいに不可能は無いのだ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 28,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "우와! 진짜? 나 한 번만 보여주라! ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ホントに！？すげー！見せてよ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_FEMALE",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "정말이야 언니? 나, 등에 한 번만 태워주면 안 돼?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "おねえちゃん本当なの？わたしも乗せてちょうだい！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
